e Games Series is an episodic adventure game developed by TellTale Games and based on the famous HBO TV-show Game of Thrones, as well as the book 'A song of Ice and Fire' by George R.R. Martin.\n\nYou play as the family members of House Forrester, a noble house from the north of Westeros, bannermen to House Glover, who has been loyal to House Stark of Winterfell for a long time. These characters are all caught up in the events of the war of the Five Kings, and they are placed in a critical position where every character must do everything in their power to prevent their precious house from going under.", "themes": [{"id": 17, "name": "Fantasy"}, {"id": 22, "name": "Historical"}, {"id": 31, "name": "Drama"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/game-of-thrones-a-telltale-games-series", "videos": [{"id": 3201, "name": "Teaser", "video_id": "sSX04LuIs-A", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sSX04LuIs-A", "title": "Game of Thrones: A Telltale Games Series - Teaser Trailer (Official)", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/sSX04LuIs-A/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 3222, "name": "Iron From Ice Launch Trailer", "video_id": "mhNSdZMUxuU", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mhNSdZMUxuU", "title": "Game of Thrones: A Telltale Games Series - Iron From Ice Launch Trailer (Official)", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/mhNSdZMUxuU/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 3184, "name": "Announcment Trailer", "video_id": "GQgv9Pkm2bY", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GQgv9Pkm2bY", "title": "Game of Thrones: A Telltale Games Series - Announcement Trailer (Official)", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/GQgv9Pkm2bY/maxresdefault.jpg"}], "collections": [{"id": 3397, "name": "A Song of Ice and Fire"}]}